Third-party components
----------------------
Nothing from another project is vendored into this repository. The scripts are
original work and read only the Python standard library, plus the runtime
dependencies below. They are not bundled here; each user installs them with
`python scripts/setup_deps.py`, and each remains under its own licence and its
own copyright:

    cryptography, pypdf, python-docx, openpyxl, Pillow
    pytesseract / paddleocr and the Tesseract or PaddleOCR engine (optional, OCR only)

